{"version":1,"content":"<p></p>\n<h2>日本新品士多啤梨可麗餅雪糕</h2>\n<p>日本森永「The Crepe」（ザ・クレープ）推出全新士多啤梨口味，於 2026 年 10 月 19 日起率先在全國便利店開賣，售價 248 日圓。採用粉紅色薄皮，外層煙韌有嚼勁，內裡則結合士多啤梨牛奶雪糕、士多啤梨醬及脆粒，再配以鬆軟鮮奶油，每口都有不同層次，賣相粉嫩吸引，士多啤梨控要食！</p>\n<p> <figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179214482314728838_17214280916ad1f5b79cce3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179214482598689657_11869992156ad1f5ba72db6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DejDccwk19g/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%96%b0%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1-%e6%97%a5%e6%9c%ac-%e9%9b%aa%e7%b3%95-ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8-ww01-2-3524920/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本新品士多啤梨可麗餅雪糕 賣相超吸引!搭配香甜士多啤梨醬</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期</a>.</p></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:19:50.432449+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":2,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T10:37:42.997816+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:17:36.682381+00:00","content_hash":"5c55cec4530b56cd3ec8fa28346bfefb59e